WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Guys, we made it
to the weekend!

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.271 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:06.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was a crazy week
in the news.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.541
Everybody's still talking
about President Trump's

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:11.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
Russia comments.
But in an interview on CBS,

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.213 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump said that
he now holds Vladimir Putin

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:16.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
personally responsible
for election interference.

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
Then Trump paused and said,

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.520
[ As Trump ] "They don't get
this show in Russia, right?

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.421 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:23.490 line:92%
They can't see that? Okay."

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.091 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:28.028 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Normal voice ]
Trump said he wants to have
another meeting with Putin.

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:31.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this time, he wants
to host Putin in Washington.

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:33.633 size:81% position:41%
Then Melania was like,
"He can have my room."

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.635 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And he goes -- Hold on.

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:36.403 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:39.539 size:81% position:41%
Director of National
Intelligence Dan Coats

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
found out during
a live interview

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:42.609 size:84% position:42% line:92%
that Putin might visit.

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:44.377 size:88% position:44%
Trump said, "Next time,
I'll have my people call

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
your people."
And then Coats was like,

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Mr. President,
I am your people.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm the one --"
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:53.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
What?
"Tell me what's going on!"

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:54.621 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you guys see this?
The newest issue

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:55.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
of "Time" magazine
just came out,

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:58.625 size:84% position:42%
and the cover features
Trump and Putin's faces

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:00.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
blended together.
Take a look at this.

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:05.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:07.100 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
When he saw that,
Trump was like,

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:10.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Trump ] "I've never seen
a more beautiful creature

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:11.871 line:92%
like that in my entire life.

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:14.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Wow."

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:16.276 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:19.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the cover's headline says,
"The Summit Crisis,"

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:22.015
but they actually thought about
using a different headline

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:22.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
for that photo.
Take a look.

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:26.152
It was almost, "Chicken Born
Without Feathers on Face."

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.520 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Time" magazine?
[ Applause ]

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:30.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
-It seems odd.

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:31.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Rude!
-Get this.

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:33.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
Microsoft said
they actually caught Russia

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:36.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
trying to meddle
in the midterm elections.

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:37.397 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Microsoft, yeah.

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:40.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
Russians knew they were busted
when Clippy the Paperclip

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:41.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
popped up and said,
"Looks like you're trying

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:45.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
to hack an election!"
They go, "Thank you, Clippy."

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:49.008 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:53.313
I heard that Trump wants to give
Air Force One a makeover.

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:55.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can tell he's serious,
'cause today he asked the cast

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:57.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
of "Queer Eye"
if they do planes.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:01.321 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:02.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
Guys, I read
that more American families

00:02:02.856 --> 00:02:05.792
are only having two kids,
which means they're aren't

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.193 size:88% position:44% line:92%
as many middle children.

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:08.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
It's all a part of the plan

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:11.197 align:start size:94% position:6%
to make middle children feel
even more left out.

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:13.133 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
It's sad.

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:16.202 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:18.037 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally,
the US Census Bureau

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:20.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
found that couples often lie
about their incomes

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:23.376 size:75% position:38%
when women make more
than their husbands.

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:26.379
In response, Jay-Z was like,
"Why's everyone looking at me?"

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:27.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
Guys, we have
a great show tonight.

00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:29.549 line:92%
Give it up for The Roots!

